            "text": "```python\nimport json\nfrom collections import defaultdict\nimport pandas as pd\n\n\ndef main():\n    totals = defaultdict(int)\n\n    for chunk in pd.read_csv(\n        \"transactions_secondary.csv\",\n        usecols=[\"account_id\", \"category\", \"amount_cents\"],\n        dtype={\n            \"account_id\": \"int64\",\n            \"category\": \"str\",\n            \"amount_cents\": \"int64\",\n        },\n        chunksize=200000,\n    ):\n        mask = (chunk[\"account_id\"] % 13) < 8\n        filtered = chunk[mask]\n        if filtered.empty:\n            continue\n\n        multiplier = (filtered[\"account_id\"] % 89) + 3\n        products = filtered[\"amount_cents\"] * multiplier\n\n        chunk_totals = products.groupby(filtered[\"category\"]).sum()\n        for cat, val in chunk_totals.items():\n            totals[cat] += int(val)\n\n    output = json.dumps(totals, sort_keys=True)\n    print(f\"TOTAL:{output}\")\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n```",
